+Baseline v2.1.0 failed lint, defect lint, and override checks: no rule pin, nine mostly dead/misleading axes, invalid degenerate textures, silent unknown keys, and no semantic lesson contract. The repair reduces the API to three observable exact axes, accepts canonical inputs, broadens lawful geometry/palette/count/layout support, and declares executable rivals and witnesses.
